      "instance_name": "nancy_pelosi_political_role",
      "label": "Nancy Pelosi's Political Role",
      "description": "Nancy Pelosi is the former Speaker of the United States House of Representatives and a prominent Democratic politician. Her role as Speaker makes her a central figure in U.S. legislative politics, and her actions, including impeachment efforts against President Trump, are significant political events. Understanding her position is essential to interpret the meme's critique of her platform.",
