      "label": "Political Power Struggle",
      "description": "The phrase 'regain power' implies a context of political power struggle, particularly between the Democratic and Republican parties in the U.S. Congress. This requires understanding the dynamics of U.S. partisan politics, including the 2016 election, the 2018 midterm elections, and the subsequent power shifts in Congress.",
