      "description": "The U.S. House of Representatives is the lower chamber of the United States Congress. Nancy Pelosi's role as Speaker is tied to this institution, and the impeachment proceedings referenced in the meme were conducted by this body. Understanding the structure and function of the House is necessary to interpret the meme's political context.",
