      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_c81820b1",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "Political opponents of Nancy Pelosi and the Democratic Party",
      "description": "The meme is designed to resonate with individuals who are critical of Nancy Pelosi's leadership, her role in impeaching Donald Trump, and her perceived economic policies. The satirical platform ('regain power, destroy the economy, impeach trump') is framed as a critique of her political motives, targeting those who view her actions as self-serving or counterproductive. The audience is likely composed of supporters of the Republican Party or conservative-leaning individuals who oppose the Democratic Party's agenda and are skeptical of Pelosi's leadership.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_c1c8abd1"
      },
